{"sourceUrl":"https://chem.dlut.edu.cn/info/1010/9679.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:30.319414+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://chem.dlut.edu.cn/info/1010/9679.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><strong><span>一、院系与学科介绍</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>大连理工大学化学学科历史悠久，特色鲜明，建有化学一级学科博士点和博士后流动站，</span><span>ESI</span><span>国际排名进入</span><span>1‰</span><span>，入选国家首轮</span><span>“</span><span>双一流</span><span>”</span><span>建设学科。</span><span>现有</span><span>1</span><span>个一级学科（</span><span>070300</span><span>化学）博士点，</span><span>4</span><span>个二级学科（</span><span>01</span><span>无机化学、</span><span>02</span><span>分析化学、</span><span>03</span><span>有机化学、</span><span>04</span><span>物理化学）硕士点。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院现有专任教师</span><span>86</span><span>人，教授（研究员）</span><span>27</span><span>人，副教授（副研究员）</span><span>45</span><span>人，博士生导师</span><span>43</span><span>人，硕士生导师</span><span>64</span><span>人，</span><span>国家级高层次和青年人才称号获得者</span><span>8</span><span>人，国家级教学名师</span><span>2</span><span>人，万人计划教学名师</span><span>2</span><span>人，全国先进工作者</span><span>1</span><span>人</span><span>。其中，</span><span>2</span><span>人次获得国家自然科学奖二等奖，</span><span>1</span><span>人获得国家杰出青年科学基金项目，</span><span>2</span><span>人获得国务院特殊津贴</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院建有科技部超分子化学与催化国际联合研究中心、大连市多源固废化学精细识别技术与利用工程研究中心、大连市智能化学重点实验室等科研平台。科研领域涵盖了能源化学、催化化学、智能化学、生命分析、化学生物学、绿色合成、功能材料等现代化学的主要领域，一批高水平研究成果在</span><span>Science</span><span>、</span><span>Nature</span><span>等国际权威期刊发表；承担了大批国家自然科学基金、国家重点研发项目课题、国家重点领域项目、中石化、中石油、中核等央企合作项目。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院毕业生升学就业率达到</span><span>100%</span><span>，主要就业方向为高等院校、中科院、英特尔、中芯国际、中石化、中石油、兵器工业、中核、航天科技等知名企业。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>二、研学营专业</span></strong></span></p><p><span>学院将在下列专业举行研学营活动。</span></p><p><span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span>专业类型</span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span>研究方向代码及名称</span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span>招生类型</span></strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>070300</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>学术型</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>化学</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>01</span><span>无机化学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士</span><span>/</span><span>直博</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>02</span><span>分析化学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士</span><span>/</span><span>直博</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>03</span><span>有机化学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士</span><span>/</span><span>直博</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>04</span><span>物理化学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士</span><span>/</span><span>直博</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><span><strong> </strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>三、营员要求</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>全国高校</span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>身心健康，学习成绩优异，综合表现优秀；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span><span>曾取得突出科研成绩或学术水平优异（须提供证明材料）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span><span>本科就读专业为化学、应用化学等近化学专业；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.</span><span>化学学科国家基础学科拔尖基地班学生无排名限制。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>四、报名流程</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>大连理工大学优秀大学生研学营报名系统（</span><span>https://yjszs.dlut.edu.cn/zsbm/logon</span><span>）</span></span></p><p><span><span>按照要求先进行注册，然后登录系统进行信息填报。报名截止时间：</span><strong><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>12</span><span>日</span><span>24</span><span>时</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>申请者须在报名系统中提交以下材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）本科学习期间成绩单，需加盖教务处公章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）成绩排名证明材料，需要加盖教务或学生工作办公室公章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）四、六级成绩单或获证证书复印件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）其他科技创新类奖项获奖证明。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>注：网报系统上传材料时注意事项</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>申请者需将待上传的证明材料以扫描或拍照的方式生成</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件或图像文件，命名方式为</span><span>“</span><span>申请编号</span><span>-</span><span>考生姓名</span><span>-</span><span>材料名称</span><span>”</span><span>，例</span><span>“20250001-</span><span>刘某某</span><span>-</span><span>本科成绩单</span><span>”</span><span>或</span><span>“20250001-</span><span>刘某某</span><span>-</span><span>成绩排名证明</span><span>”</span><span>等，上传附件大小不得超过</span><span>20MB</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>初审通过营员确认参营信息：</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院将对申请者材料进行初审，初审通过后营员可通过报名系统</span><span>“</span><span>申请状态查询</span><span>”</span><span>模块查询本人是否入围研学营，对于审核通过的营员须于</span><strong><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>14</span><span>日</span><span>18</span><span>点</span></span><span>前</span></strong><span>在研学营报名系统中点击</span><span>“</span><span>确认参营</span><span>”</span><span>，对于逾期不确认参营的申请者将取消其参营资格。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>五、活动安排</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>研学营拟于</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日</span><span>-18</span><span>日线下开展，主要活动安排如下：</span></span></p><p><span></span></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><strong><span>日期</span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日（周三）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>营员报到</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日（周四）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>开营仪式（学院简介、学科介绍）</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>教授讲座</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>实验室参观</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日（周五）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>课题组参观交流、营员学习交流</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span></span></p><div><p><br/></p></div><p><span><span>入围研学营学生加入</span><span>QQ</span><span>群（群号：</span><span>641350573</span><span>，加群时请备注本人申请专业</span><span>+</span><span>真实姓名），相关活动安排等将通过</span><span>QQ</span><span>群通知各位同学。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>六、食宿安排与注意事项</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1. </span><span>本次研学营不收取任何费用，入选研学营的学生住宿自理（餐食及营服统一安排）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span><span>对于入选研学营的异地学生</span><span>,</span><span>最终录取为我校</span><span>2026</span><span>年推免生，可报销参加研学营时的往返路费（火车硬卧（硬座）、高铁（动车）二等座、轮船三等舱等费用，其他交通工具按照火车硬卧标准折算）。报销时需提供车票原件（飞机需提供航空运输电子客票行程单原件和付款记录），具体报销办法另行通知，无法提供票据原件、不符合财务政策和要求的不予报销；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>所有营员自行购买短期意外保险；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span><strong><span>建议入围研学营的学生积极主动与感兴趣专业方向的导师进行交流沟通，提前了解学科专业情况。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>七、联系方式</span></strong></span></p><p><span>联系人：邵老师</span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span><span>0411-84706294</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span><span><a href=\"mailto:syting@dlut.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>syting@dlut.edu.cn</span></a></span></span></p><p><span>说明：若本通知与学校或上级单位发布的新规定不符，按照学校或上级单位发布的新规定执行。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><strong><span>希望本次研学营活动能促进优秀大学生之间的交流，</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>帮助热爱化学的学生了解大连理工大学化学学院。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>预祝各位同学在此期间筑下梦想、结下友谊，化学学院欢迎大家！</span></strong></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>化学学院</span></p><p><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"7148662d8ce462ec1ff344eb3f0c4977a5e9d2f6a879dcfe7375c47d3b0732da","textLength":1913,"sourceSha256":"e6525670ea222f2d1bf2225638cbd2253e48010e6bbfae1353bc831446d1f012","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-95b31b138db6cee2319e","title":"2025年大连理工大学化学学院2026年暑期优秀大学生研学营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:30.319414+00:00"}
